.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tine-move 1  "move " 
.SH NAME
tine\-move \- Move a block, with its children, under, after or before another block on the same page
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine move\fR [\fB\-\-under\fR] [\fB\-\-after\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-before\fR] [\fB\-g\fR|\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-rev\fR] [\fB\-\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-author\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIBLOCK\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move a block, with its children, under, after or before another block on the same page
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-under\fR \fI<TARGET>\fR
As the last child of TARGET
.TP
\fB\-\-after\fR \fI<TARGET>\fR
Right after TARGET, as its next sibling
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-\-before\fR \fI<TARGET>\fR
Right before TARGET, as its previous sibling
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<GRAPH>\fR
The graph. Defaults to $TINE_GRAPH, else the graph folder around the current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the typed result (schema tine.cli/1) as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-rev\fR \fI<REV>\fR
Write only if the page is still at this rev (as `page show` prints it); required for a bare PAGE/POS without a fingerprint
.TP
\fB\-\-run\fR \fI<RUN>\fR
Commit this write to the graph\*(Aqs git repository as part of RUN (from `tine run begin`)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBTINE_RUN\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-author\fR \fI<AUTHOR>\fR
Author on created blocks and on the run\*(Aqs commits (default: agent)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBTINE_AUTHOR\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIBLOCK\fR>

